The console print RTLMeter added to OpenPiton's pc_cmp appends a byte of the PC
to a string with no cast, in every configuration. IEEE 1800-2023 6.16 says
integral values assigned to a string "require a cast", and Table 6-9 allows only
string literals and string expressions in a string concatenation. Cast the byte;
it prints the same. Written with no context lines, since the same line repeats
1365 times.

Reported as https://github.com/verilator/rtlmeter/issues/58

